***
000  Disk 000 is BAKUP's 'Greatest Hits' disk.  No file is included on
000  this disk that does not appear somewhere else in their library.
000  -KAYFUN .000 - This disk originally BAKUP Volume 0.
000  DISK-000.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
000  COMHEX  .COM - Converts a COM file back into hex.  Very useful for
000  COMHEX  .DOC - file transfers without error checking.
000  COMPARE .COM - Compares text files.
000  SD98    .COM - Produces a detailed, sorted directory with file sizes.
000  SD98    .DOC - 
000  SD-44   .COM - An older, but smaller version of the above program.
000  FBAD59  .COM - Finds and locks out bad sectors on a disk.
000  FBAD59  .DOC - 
000  UNERA30 .COM - Unerases accidentally erased files.
000  UNERA30 .DOC - 
000  DIRCHK  .COM - Gives sector allocation of files and spots directory
000               -   errors.
000  NEWCAT  .COM - A set of programs to catalog the contents of your
000  CAT     .COM -   disks and tell you what is where.
000  CAT2    .COM -   |
000  NEWCAT28.DOC -   |  
000  READ    .COM - TYPE to console with pause.
000  EX14    .COM - A fantastic replacement for SUBMIT and XSUB.
000  EX14    .DOC - 
000  PRINT   .BAS - Epson printer print mode controller.
000  QUIET   .COM - Turns off keyboard click.
000  LOUD    .COM - Turns click back on.
000  NSWP207 .COM - A powerful file moving and maintenance utility.
000  NSWP207 .DOC - 
000  PRINT   .COM - Prints files in paged format.  Several options.
000  PRINT   .DOC - 
000  KTRADE  .BAS - Dramatically improved Star Traders.
000  ZCHESS  .COM - A Z80 chess game with variable look-ahead.
000  DU-V89  .COM - A powerful, useful disk editor.
000  DU-V87  .DOC - 
000  DASM    .COM - A conversational Z80 disassembler.
000  DASM    .DOC - 
000  QK      .COM - A resident keystroke command system that allows you to
000  QK      .DOC -   redefine any keya at any time.
