029  FORMAT  .BAS - Asks questions about Perfect Writer style options and
029  FORMAT  .DOC -   creates file containing style commands.
029  NSWP205 .COM - A powerful file moving and maintenance utility.  This
029  NSWP205 .DOC -   version (4/11/84) allows squeezing and unsqueezing
029  NSWP205 .UPD -   files, including files assembled into libraries.
029  PRINTER .COM - John Wood's Epson printer initialization program.
029  PW-RESET.COM - D. Jamieson's drive reset modification for PW - run it!
029  ROMDUMP .COM - Steve Willett's program to dump an image of ROM to a
029  ROMDUMP .ASM -   disk file, in source and object.  See DASM-CPM.DOC.
029  DASM-CPM.DOC - Documentation for CPM and ROMDUMP files on this disk.
029  CPM     .CTL - Files created by Steve Willett for disassembling CP/M
029  CPM     .SYM -   with the DASM disassembler.  They are for CP/M 2.2 as
029  CPM     .DOC -   distributed with the Kaypro 2.
029  SDUMP   .COM - Ken Fowler's Screen Dump utility.  Send everything on
029  SDUMP   .DOC -   your screen to the printer.  Works with PW, WS etc.
